          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.52,
          "end": 6.17,
          "en": "So in this video we will be discussing about a new topic which is called Soft Delete.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.17,
          "end": 9.89,
          "en": "So soft delete is a really powerful feature of Eloquent Model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.92,
          "end": 15.5,
          "en": "By that you can delete a item, but it will not permanently delete from the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.59,
          "end": 17.03,
          "en": "It will be in the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.03,
          "end": 23.09,
          "en": "But when you will retrieve the data, you will be not able to see the deleted data in the result.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.09,
          "end": 30.02,
          "en": "But later on, if you decide to recover or you can say restore the deleted data, you will be able to",
          "zh": ""
        },
