          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 42.56,
          "end": 44.9,
          "en": "Uh, let's say any file or anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 44.9,
          "end": 50.03,
          "en": "Then you can go to the go to the recycle bin and recover it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 50.03,
          "end": 54.47,
          "en": "Or you can say restore it or also you can permanently delete it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 54.47,
          "end": 55.43,
          "en": "So same feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.46,
          "end": 57.86,
          "en": "Laravel provides an eloquent as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.86,
          "end": 62.45,
          "en": "So if you want to delete a data you can delete it with with a soft delete.",
